  <name>AltSendme</name>
  <summary>Frictionless peer-to-peer file transfer</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      AltSendme sends files directly between devices over an encrypted
      peer-to-peer connection with NAT hole punching, so transfers do not pass
      through a central server. Pick files, share a ticket, and the receiver
      pulls them straight from your machine.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Direct device-to-device transfer with NAT traversal</li>
      <li>No account required and no file size limits</li>
      <li>Encrypted connections</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
